{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmeNdpUAmjzZRPK6Juys","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**What I decided:** I'd put the 30K into a daily money-market fund (קרן כספית יומית). I'm fairly sure, but I'd check the fee before buying. What decided it was the bar chart: the עו\"ש pays \"0%\" and the קרן כספית יומית pays \"3.25%\" (\"לפי ריבית בנק ישראל\"), and you can still get the money out \"ביום מסחר\". So it's fine for money I might need soon, just not on the same day.\n\n**What it is:** a fund that puts the money only into short, safe stuff like bank deposits and מק\"מ (no idea what מק\"מ is). The text said \"סיכון נמוך\" and \"אין תשואה מובטחת\". You buy it through a securities account at the bank or with a broker.\n\n**What it costs:** I still don't know. There's a \"כמה זה עולה\" table that lists דמי ניהול, שכר נאמן, עמלת קנייה ומכירה and דמי ניהול פיקדון ניירות ערך. It has no actual number, not even a percent, let alone shekels. And next to almost every fee it says \"אין תקרה בחוק\", which scared me a bit. From \"שווה לדעת\" I got one useful line: \"אין דמי משמרת על מק\"ם וקרן כספית בבנק\". I don't know what דמי משמרת are, but OK, there aren't any. The return there is \"אחרי דמי ניהול, לפני מס, לא מובטחת\". So I'm not sure the 3.25% in the chart is what I'd actually get.\n\n**First step:** open a securities account at my bank, find a קרן כספית from a big name I know, and ask what the דמי ניהול are in shekels.\n\n**Short account:**\n- **Order I looked:** the heading \"קרן כספית\" and the line under it. Then \"מה זה\" (first lines only), then \"למה משתמשים בזה\". That one clicked: \"כסף שצריך להישאר זמין: קרן חירום\". Then the bar chart, then \"שווה לדעת\", then the cost table. After that I scrolled past \"מיסוי\" (only \"אין מס בזמן ההחזקה\" and \"25%\" stuck), \"סיכונים ומה לא מוגן\", \"מה האתר לקח בחשבון\" and the \"מונחים\" table. At \"מונחים\" I was bored, basically done.\n- **Skipped:** most of the long paragraphs, the \"הצגת החוקים והכללים\" links, the little tags (MF-11, TXS-24 and so on), the \"שחקו עם המספרים שלכם\" fold and the footer.\n- **Words I didn't get:** מק\"מ, נאמן, דמי משמרת, הריבית הריאלי, הרווח הנומינלי, קרן כספית מתחדשת, השעה היעודה, מפיץ, קרן נאמנות חייבת/פטורה, תשקיף.\n- **Not sure I read right:** I first read \"3.25%\" as what I'd get. Then I saw the small line under the chart, \"ריבית שנתית לפני מס ועלויות\", so it's before tax and fees. Also, \"4 מתוך 8 הבנקים\" pay 0% on the עו\"ש, but some pay 3% up to 10,000 ₪. Does my bank? No idea.\n- **What bothered me:** I came to find out what it costs, and there's no number anywhere. I'd also go look for which funds to pick. It's walls of small text, and there's no button for a next step."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5513,"cache_read_input_tokens":15419,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5513},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d1ff72be-363b-4895-a946-37621c821141","uuid":"8bed50c9-e152-4b3f-bed2-057d2d785cb0","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:06:21.094Z","request_id":"req_011CgmeNdWcbsAEuXeZkg6uG"}
